## Skill Combination Rules

| Task Type | Primary Skill | Secondary Skill | Review Gates Applied |
|---|---|---|---|
| Landing page mới | frontend-taste | full-output + frontend-review | taste-pre + taste-post + fulloutput-pre + fulloutput-post + review-pre + review-post |
| Redesign existing site | frontend-redesign | full-output + frontend-review | redesign-pre + redesign-post + fulloutput-pre + fulloutput-post + review-pre + review-post |
| Greenfield frontend build | frontend-taste | full-output + frontend-review | taste-pre + taste-post + fulloutput-pre + fulloutput-post + review-pre + review-post |
| Multi-file implementation | full-output | frontend-review | fulloutput-pre + fulloutput-post + review-pre + review-post |
| Code review / quality check | frontend-review | (standalone) | review-pre + review-post |
| Vietnam payment integration | vietnam-payment-review | security-review + billing-review | payment-review-pre + payment-review-post + security-review-pre + security-review-post |
| Payment code review | vietnam-payment-review | security-review | payment-review-pre + payment-review-post + security-review-pre + security-review-post |
| Security vulnerability review | security-review | (standalone or combined with relevant domain skill) | security-review-pre + security-review-post + [domain skill gates] |
| API security review | security-review | (standalone) | security-review-pre + security-review-post + API-specific checks |
| APK/binary/JS reverse-engineering | security-review | reverse-skill routing | security-review-pre + RE skill gate + security-review-post |

