**B.3 Accessibility Review:**
- [ ] All images have meaningful alt text (no `alt=""` on meaningful images)
- [ ] Color contrast passes WCAG AA: 4.5:1 body text, 3:1 large text
- [ ] Form labels associated with inputs (htmlFor/id or aria-label)
- [ ] Focus indicators visible for keyboard navigation
